@startuml
title Migración de Assets UiPath (Pipeline + API)

skinparam padding 20
skinparam ParticipantPadding 30
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam SequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Desarrollador" as Dev

participant Git
participant "Azure Pipeline" as Pipeline
participant "PowerShell Script" as PS
participant "UiPath Identity" as Auth
participant "UiPath Orchestrator\n(Nueva Cuenta)" as Orchestrator

Dev -> Git : Paso 1:\nSube assets.json + scripts

Git -> Pipeline : Paso 2:\nTrigger pipeline

Pipeline -> PS : Paso 3:\nEjecuta import-assets.ps1

PS -> Auth : Paso 4:\nPOST /connect/token\n(client_credentials)
Auth --> PS : access_token

PS -> Git : Paso 5:\nLee assets.json

== Paso 6: Creación de Assets ==

loop Por cada asset
    PS -> Orchestrator : Paso 6.1:\nPOST /odata/Assets\n(Header: FolderId)
    Orchestrator --> PS : OK / Error
end

PS --> Pipeline : Paso 7:\nResultado ejecución
Pipeline --> Dev : Paso 8:\nLogs

@enduml